stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Reading: Read vendor meetings
    Reading --> SourceUnavailable: Calendar read fails or source is missing
    Reading --> InvalidDurationUnavailable: A displayed meeting has no duration
    Reading --> SourceUnavailable: Coverage is stale, future, malformed, or truncated
    Reading --> CoveredReady: Fresh coverage has gaps of at least thirty minutes
    Reading --> CoveredEmpty: Fresh coverage has no qualifying gaps
    Reading --> WarningPartial: Known warnings and qualifying gaps
    SourceUnavailable: Scheduling unavailable, no candidate gaps
    InvalidDurationUnavailable: Scheduling unavailable, agenda stays visible
    CoveredReady: Show candidate gaps, confirm in Outlook
    CoveredEmpty: No candidate gaps
    WarningPartial: Show candidate gaps with uncertainty
    SourceUnavailable --> [*]
    InvalidDurationUnavailable --> [*]
    CoveredReady --> [*]
    CoveredEmpty --> [*]
    WarningPartial --> [*]
    %% never Offer candidate gaps when a displayed meeting has zero duration.
    %% never Rewrite a missing or delayed source as an empty calendar.
    %% The awaited database read settles before projection. No owned background work or teardown.
